<Positioned left="88" top="906"><Text fontSize="18" color="#8494AE" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">合计率 = 成交合计 ÷ 访问合计，不是两渠道率的平均</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="620" top="640" width="916" height="300"><Container width="916" height="300" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="16" border="1 SOLID #E3EAF4" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="632" top="664" width="5" height="252"><Container width="5" height="252" color="#7C3AED" borderRadius="2" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="658"><Text fontSize="26" color="#17233D" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">直接与推广的转化率都上升（+5.0pp、+2.0pp），总体却下降 9.4pp</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="694"><Text fontSize="26" color="#17233D" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">分组与总体不同向：改善与恶化同时成立（辛普森悖论）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="748"><Text fontSize="22" color="#55657F" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">验证：总体率 = 总成交 ÷ 总访问 = Σ(各渠道访问占比 × 各渠道率)</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="786"><Text fontSize="22" color="#55657F" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">前期 0.8×30.0% + 0.2×10.0% = 26.0%；后期 0.2×35.0% + 0.8×12.0% = 16.6%</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="824"><Text fontSize="22" color="#55657F" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">两个误读：把渠道率的平均当总体；把同期不同渠道的成交数差当转化升降</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="636" top="858" width="872" height="66"><Container width="872" height="66" color="#FFF7E6" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #F2CE93" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="866"><Text fontSize="22" color="#8A5A11" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">因果限制：本数据只含两期两渠道的汇总计数，未控制人群、产品与活动等同期变化；</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="656" top="892"><Text fontSize="22" color="#8A5A11" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">不能证明任何调整“导致”转化率变化，也不能断言“某渠道拖累了总体”。</Text></Positioned>
</Stack>
</Snapshot>
